# [FABLE-5] sq-t999y — compact ACP decision corpus, derived from the
# crates/sparq-solid/src/fixture.rs seed. ACP inheritance is CUMULATIVE (every
# ancestor's memberAccessControl applies), so the root owner policy reaches
# everywhere — the key WAC difference. Shapes: priv0 (owner-only), pub1 (public),
# team2 (anyOf enumerated agents), friends3 (allOf agent+client pair), mixed4
# (public + deny-overrides), origin5 (public noneOf carol -> conditional grant).
<https://pod.ex/priv0/d0.ttl#it> <https://ex.dev/ns#title> "priv0 doc" <https://pod.ex/priv0/d0.ttl> .
<https://pod.ex/pub1/d0.ttl#it> <https://ex.dev/ns#title> "pub1 doc" <https://pod.ex/pub1/d0.ttl> .
<https://pod.ex/team2/d0.ttl#it> <https://ex.dev/ns#title> "team2 doc" <https://pod.ex/team2/d0.ttl> .
<https://pod.ex/friends3/d0.ttl#it> <https://ex.dev/ns#title> "friends3 doc" <https://pod.ex/friends3/d0.ttl> .
<https://pod.ex/mixed4/d0.ttl#it> <https://ex.dev/ns#title> "mixed4 doc" <https://pod.ex/mixed4/d0.ttl> .
<https://pod.ex/origin5/d0.ttl#it> <https://ex.dev/ns#title> "origin5 doc" <https://pod.ex/origin5/d0.ttl> .
